      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is not a VRChat Issue. As of [SteamVR 2.7](https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/250820/view/4371390626087848465), applications are blocked from seeing controller/tracker positions while the Steam keyboard is visible. When you open the keyboard now, the game pretty much just sees them as disabled/at a default position.\n\nYou can disable this functionality in The SteamVR 2.8 beta that is currently running. [Guide](https://help.steampowered.com/en/faqs/view/4F5E-AD22-7402-2EAD)",
